Parameter(s):	Year of eruption [a AD] (Eruption) * PI: Sigl, Michael (https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9028-9703, michael.sigl@unibe.ch) * COMMENT: defined as the year in which volcanic sulfate deposition in the polar ice cores started to rise; exact year is provided for known eruption dates (e.g. Tambora in 1815); the dating is primarily based on independent annual-layer counted chronologies from both Greenland and Antarctica
	Year of eruption [a AD] (Eruption) * PI: Sigl, Michael (https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9028-9703, michael.sigl@unibe.ch) * COMMENT: ISO (same as before, but using the ISO8601 international standard date (which includes a year 0))
	Month (Month) * PI: Sigl, Michael (https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9028-9703, michael.sigl@unibe.ch) * COMMENT: of eruption (default date of 1 January for unknown eruption dates)
	Day (Day) * PI: Sigl, Michael (https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9028-9703, michael.sigl@unibe.ch)
	LATITUDE (Latitude) * GEOCODE * PI: Sigl, Michael (https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9028-9703, michael.sigl@unibe.ch) * COMMENT: Estimated eruption latitude (default latitudes for unidentified eruptions detected only in Greenland were 45°N, eruptions detected only in Antarctica 45°S, and 0° if they were detected on Greenland and Antarctica)
	Deposition of sulfate, volcanic, cumulative [kg/m**2] (Volc [SO4]2- depos cum) * PI: Sigl, Michael (https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9028-9703, michael.sigl@unibe.ch) * COMMENT: Greenland volcanic sulfate
	Deposition of sulfate, volcanic, cumulative [kg/m**2] (Volc [SO4]2- depos cum) * PI: Sigl, Michael (https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9028-9703, michael.sigl@unibe.ch) * COMMENT: Antarctic volcanic sulfate
	Volcanic stratospheric sulfur injection [Tg] (VSSI) * PI: Sigl, Michael (https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9028-9703, michael.sigl@unibe.ch) * COMMENT: stratospheric sulfur injection
	Volcanic stratospheric sulfur injection, standard deviation [±] (VSSI std dev) * PI: Sigl, Michael (https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9028-9703, michael.sigl@unibe.ch) * COMMENT: 1-sigma uncertainty of stratospheric sulfur injection
	Asymmetry (Asymmetry) * PI: Sigl, Michael (https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9028-9703, michael.sigl@unibe.ch) * COMMENT: ASY=(DG/(DG+DA)), DG= Greenland sulfate deposition, DA = Antarctica sulfate deposition
	Location (Location) * PI: Sigl, Michael (https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9028-9703, michael.sigl@unibe.ch)
	Tephra layer (Tephra lay) * PI: Sigl, Michael (https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9028-9703, michael.sigl@unibe.ch) * COMMENT: tephra detected in polar ice cores (Y, for positive; N, for no tephra reported)
	Reference/source (Reference) * PI: Sigl, Michael (https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9028-9703, michael.sigl@unibe.ch)
